# Test-only dependency input for the ONE full-suite lane (v4.9.0).
#
# The controller generates the hash-locked test-requirements.lock from this
# file with the exact pinned uv (0.12.5). The full-test lane installs the
# runtime lock FIRST, then this lock on top with --require-hashes, so test
# tooling can never silently upgrade/downgrade a runtime pin: every overlap
# resolves to the same hash-pinned version or the install fails loudly.
#
# NOTE: pytest-rerunfailures is deliberately ABSENT. There are NO automatic
# reruns: a rerun is controller-authorized only after a confirmed infra-flake
# or byte change.
pytest
pytest-cov
hypothesis
psutil
pyyaml
